  "whole_source_bridge": "rho\u00b2=-2delta*a has two nonzero complex choices for each delta*a unit; kappa is not inverted. Generic e nonzero true T17 and polynomial center recover all original25 source by accepted explicit affine inverse.",
  "job_sha256": "c435cbc770c5aaa064ebad61529c62bfb1f4ba6a003118e403acf48eda308745",
